	(text "*quadrature hardware encoding:\nthere's hardware designed to detect the 2 encoder signals TI1,TI2\nand increment/decrement a counter which is saved to a register\nwithout CPU calls (independantly) AND also detect the direction\n\nHINTS:\nTo select Encoder Interface mode write in the TIMx_SMCR register\nSMS=0001 if the counter is counting on tim_ti1 edges only,\nSMS=0010 if it is counting on tim_ti2 edges only and \nSMS=0011 if it is counting on both tim_ti1 and tim_ti2 edges\n\nThe DIR bit in the TIMx_CR1 register is updated by hardware\nto reflect the movement direction\n\nDigital Filtering (IC1F / IC2F bits in TIMx_CCMR1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.846 140.716 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e1b06018-585c-4cb9-887a-83a06778bcd9")
	)
